        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Summary\r\nOnline Auction Date: 22nd October 2026.\r\nDetached four bedroom cottage.\r\nOverlooking Woodford River.\r\nExtending to approximately 144 sq. m (1,550 sq. ft).\r\nIn need of refurbishment.\r\nOil fired central heating.\r\nLocated approximately 5km from Ballyconnell town.\r\nOn a site area extending to approximately 0.11 hectares (0.27 acres).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nProperty Description\r\nPMC Real Estate are delighted to offer for sale this four bedroom detached cottage overlooking Woodford River. The accommodation comprises an open plan kitchen/living/dining room, utility, storeroom, lounge, bedroom, & bathroom. The stairs leads to the first floor which consists of landing area, three bedrooms & storage/hot press. The property benefits from side access and enclosed rear garden. Local amenities can be accessed in nearby Ballyconnell town and include a wide range of shops, schools, bars, restaurants & sports clubs.\r\n\r\nTenancy\r\nVacant possession\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nGround Floor\r\nKitchen/Living/Dining Room:\r\nUtility:\r\nStoreroom:\r\nLounge:\r\nBedroom One:\r\nBathroom:\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding:\r\nBedroom Two: \r\nBedroom Three: \r\nBedroom Four: \r\nStorage/Hot Press: \r\n\r\nAdditional Details\r\nFor further information regarding the auction process, registering to bid and viewing the property please contact Patrick McCormack on 086-4634687"
